=== 2. 确定性拒绝(CLAIM_MISMATCH,不手工中和)===
  ✅ deny: approval→FAILED
  ✅ deny: outbox→FAILED
  ✅ deny: attempts=1
  ✅ deny: task HOLD(l2_drain_denied)
  ✅ 再 drain(lease 过期):attempts 仍 1(不重派)

=== 3. 瞬时退避(不可达 Gateway → TRANSIENT,不终结)===
  ✅ trans: approval 留 APPROVED(未终结)
  ✅ trans: outbox 留 DISPATCHED
  ✅ trans: attempts=1(领取一次)
  ✅ trans: next_retry_at 未来(退避)
  ✅ trans: last_error_code=TRANSIENT
  ✅ 立即再 drain:attempts 仍 1(退避期不领取)

=== 4. 公平调度(outbox next_retry_at) ===
  ✅ next_retry_at 未来 → 不领取(attempts=0)
  ✅ next_retry_at 到期 → 领取并 merge(task MERGED)

=== 5. 工作预算(单 tick ≤ MAX_ITEMS=3)===
  ✅ 单 tick 处理 2 条(≤ MAX_ITEMS=3,未一次处理 5)
  ✅ 下一 tick 处理剩余 2(累计 5)

